MID_ADVICE_TypeRank_001: Novice
MID_ADVICE_TypeRank_002: Avancé
MID_ADVICE_TypeRank_003: Élite
MID_ADVICE_TypeRank_004: Suprême
MID_ADVICE_TypeRank_005: Divin
